  "body": "## Summary\\n- fail closed for expired, stale, revoked, malformed, or credential-broken stored Internet leases before enabling the Android Internet Connect preview action\\n- render expired/stale Internet profile summaries through store admission state and keep Scan, Import, and Revoke available for recovery\\n- add focused JVM contracts plus Nubia P0110 Android-local no-Host evidence for expired/stale lease UX\\n\\n## Verification\\n- (cd baseline/AndroidClient && ./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.MainActivityTerminalGuidanceContractTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.internet.InternetSessionProfileStorePairingBindingTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.internet.InternetSessionProfileStoreRevocationRecoveryTest)\\n- (cd baseline/AndroidClient && ./gradlew :app:compileDebugAndroidTestKotlin)\\n- shasum -a 256 -c docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-16-nubia-p0110-internet-expired-stale-lease-ux/SHA256SUMS\\n- git diff --check\\n- Retained focused device evidence: docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-16-nubia-p0110-internet-expired-stale-lease-ux/README.md\\n\\n## Evidence boundary\\n- Android-local no-Host evidence only, on Nubia P0110/pacific Android 16 device <redacted-adb-serial>.\\n- This does not prove production Authority issuance, public Internet signaling, WebRTC direct/relay traversal, Host readiness, ScreenCaptureKit/VideoToolbox media, Android decoder output, clipboard/file-transfer product E2E, or macOS TCC/signing readiness.\\n- The focused expired/stale run did not grant Camera and did not request Accessibility permission.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n  - Added clear Internet profile statuses for ready, stale, expired, revoked, missing, and invalid leases.\n  - Connect is disabled when a lease cannot be used or requires a fresh profile.\n  - Scan, Import, and Revoke remain available for recovery.\n  - Importing a fresh lease restores connection availability.\n\n- **Bug Fixes**\n  - Profile status now refreshes after returning to the app, reconnect attempts, disconnection, and activity recreation.\n  - Improved accessibility descriptions explain unavailable connection states.\n\n- **Tests & Documentation**\n  - Added Android coverage and audit evidence for expired and stale lease recovery flows.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
